      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.52,
      "end_seconds": 3.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "sorry I'm a little late, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.24,
      "end_seconds": 9.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.63,
      "end_seconds": 14.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.33,
      "end_seconds": 17.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "it's tiredness, mostly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.8,
      "end_seconds": 21.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.91,
      "end_seconds": 39.42,
      "duration_seconds": 16.51,
      "text": "For about a week, I'd say. And morning stiffness for an hour, too. With morning stiffness for an hour, about a seven out of ten. It's on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.83,
      "end_seconds": 45.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "Have you had tiredness before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.42,
      "end_seconds": 52.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "Hmm, I had a similar thing about six months ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.75,
      "end_seconds": 71.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "And fever, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.84,
      "end_seconds": 77.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "no, I haven't had any fever"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.7,
      "end_seconds": 80.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Any eye redness, chest pain or rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.64,
      "end_seconds": 85.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.57,
      "end_seconds": 89.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.21,
      "end_seconds": 91.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "nothing odd there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.58,
      "end_seconds": 95.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.27,
      "end_seconds": 100.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "nothing, I haven't had any operations"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.85,
      "end_seconds": 103.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 105.31,
      "end_seconds": 109.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "It's, It's ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, when needed, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.42,
      "end_seconds": 111.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.67,
      "end_seconds": 116.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.4,
      "end_seconds": 120.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.19,
      "end_seconds": 125.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.36,
      "end_seconds": 129.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "what do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.44,
      "end_seconds": 133.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.82,
      "end_seconds": 139.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.14,
      "end_seconds": 144.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.03,
      "end_seconds": 162.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.02,
      "end_seconds": 168.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "no, uh, nothing I can think of"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.88,
      "end_seconds": 172.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.16,
      "end_seconds": 181.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.18,
      "end_seconds": 218.09,
      "duration_seconds": 14.91,
      "text": "okay: weight 76 kilos, pulse is 64 beats a a minute, height 162 centimetres, temp 36.6 degrees, pressure 126 over 77, BMI works out to 29.0, SpO2 97 percent on room air"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.36,
      "end_seconds": 224.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "I'll need to to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.47,
      "end_seconds": 227.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.2,
      "end_seconds": 229.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.57,
      "end_seconds": 251.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "the knuckles and wrists are swollen and warm, and the squeeze test is painful"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.64,
      "end_seconds": 257.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.87,
      "end_seconds": 281.66,
      "duration_seconds": 11.79,
      "text": "okay, so my impression is this: It's hard to say an inflammatory arthritis flare is one possibility and osteoarthritis another, and I'd rather not commit yet"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.09,
      "end_seconds": 286.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "what are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.12,
      "end_seconds": 305.35,
      "duration_seconds": 17.23,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's an inflammatory arthritis flare, and we'll watch how it goes. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had tiredness for about a week, and no fever or eye redness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.1,
      "end_seconds": 307.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Mm, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.66,
      "end_seconds": 316.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.78,
      "text": "Gentle hand exercises and warm water in the morning. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.76,
      "end_seconds": 321.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
